---
layout: layouts/base.njk
noTranslation: true
robots: "noindex, follow"
pagination:
  data: retiredUrls
  size: 1
  alias: retiredUrl
eleventyComputed:
  permalink: "{{ retiredUrl }}"
  title: "{{ withdrawal.title }}"
  description: "{{ withdrawal.line }}"
---

{#- Implements [WITHDRAWAL-COPY-SHORT]. One notice at every URL the site used to
    serve (_data/retiredUrls.json), so a link from an installed binary, a search
    result, or someone's bookmark lands on the explanation instead of a 404.
    Copy comes from the messaging spec via _data/withdrawal.json — never edit it
    here. -#}
<article class="notice">
  {% for paragraph in withdrawal.short %}
  <p>{{ paragraph | safe }}</p>
  {% endfor %}
  <p><a href="/">Read the full statement</a></p>
</article>
